{"path":"utility/functional/function/operator()","title":"std::function<R(Args...)>::operator()","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::function&lt;R(Args...)&gt;::</span>operator()","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/function/operator()","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Invokes the stored callable function target with the parameters args.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">R operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> Args... <span class=\"me1\">args</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Invokes the stored callable function target with the parameters <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">args</span></code>.\n</p><p>Effectively does <code class=\"t-c\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional\"><code><i>INVOKE&lt;R&gt;</i></code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args<span class=\"br0\">)</span>...<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f</span></code> is the <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\">target object</a> of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> args\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> parameters to pass to the stored callable function target\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>None if <code>R</code> is <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span></span>. Otherwise the return value of the invocation of the stored callable object.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/bad_function_call\">std::bad_function_call</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> does not store a callable function target, i.e. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>The following example shows how <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\">std::function</a></span> can be passed to other functions by value. Also, it shows how <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\">std::function</a></span> can store lambdas.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;functional&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> call<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\"><span class=\"kw1066\">std::<span class=\"me2\">function</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> f<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// can be passed by value</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span> \n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> normal_function<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\"><span class=\"kw1066\">std::<span class=\"me2\">function</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> f<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">try</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        call<span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">catch</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/bad_function_call\"><span class=\"kw1070\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bad_function_call</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ex<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> ex.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    f <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>n<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> n<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    call<span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    call<span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    f <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> normal_function<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    call<span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\"><span class=\"kw1066\">std::<span class=\"me2\">function</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> g<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    g <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> str, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> str <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    g<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Hi\"</span>, <span class=\"nu8\">052</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>bad_function_call\n1\n2\n42\nHi 42</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/move_only_function/operator()\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes the target <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::move_only_function</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/reference_wrapper/operator()\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  calls the stored function <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::reference_wrapper&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/bad_function_call\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>bad_function_call</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  the exception thrown when invoking an empty <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\">std::function</a></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/invoke\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>invoke</span><span>invoke_r</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes any <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Callable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Callable</em></a> object with given arguments <span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx23\"><span>and possibility to specify return type</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span></span></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/functional","title":"Function objects"},{"path":"utility/functional/function","title":"std::function"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::function<R(Args...)>::operator()","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Invokes the stored callable function target with the parameters args."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"args"},{"label":"Return value","note":"None if R is void. Otherwise the return value of the invocation of the stored callable object."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws std::bad_function_call if *this does not store a callable function target, i.e. !*this == true."},{"label":"Example","note":"The following example shows how std::function can be passed to other functions by value."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator()","note":"invokes the target"},{"label":"operator()","note":"calls the stored function"},{"label":"bad_function_call","note":"the exception thrown when invoking an empty std::function"},{"label":"invoke, invoke_r","note":"invokes any Callable object with given arguments and possibility to specify return type(since C++23)"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17","C++23"],"wordCount":245,"codeBlockCount":2}
